{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55989","headline":"殿试茘枝诗 · 陈用拙","name":"殿试茘枝诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"露湿臙脂拂眼明，红袍千裹画难成。\n佳人胜尽盘中味，天意偏教岭外生。\n橘柚远惭登贡籍，盐梅应合共和羹。\n金门若得栽培地，须占人间第一名。\n（见清汪森辑《粤西诗载》卷十三）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈用拙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55989.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55989","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}